---
import { Plus } from '@lucide/astro';
---

<section id="hiring-faq" class="hiring-faq" aria-labelledby="hiring-faq-title">
  <div class="faq-heading">
    <h2 id="hiring-faq-title">For hiring teams</h2>
    <p>A few useful details before we connect.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="faq-questions">
    <details>
      <summary><span class="faq-number" aria-hidden="true">01</span><span>What roles are you considering?</span><Plus class="faq-icon" aria-hidden="true" size={20} stroke-width={1.5} /></summary>
      <div class="faq-answer"><p>I am open to IT Support, Service Desk, Desktop Support, Systems, Network, and Cloud or Platform opportunities.</p></div>
    </details>
    <details>
      <summary><span class="faq-number" aria-hidden="true">02</span><span>Which résumé should I download?</span><Plus class="faq-icon" aria-hidden="true" size={20} stroke-width={1.5} /></summary>
      <div class="faq-answer">
        <p>Choose IT Support for support, service desk, and desktop roles. Choose Systems &amp; Cloud for systems, networking, and platform roles.</p>
        <ul class="faq-resumes">
          <li><a href="/resume/lorenz-tazan-it-support.pdf">IT Support résumé <span>PDF</span></a></li>
          <li><a href="/resume/lorenz-tazan-systems-cloud.pdf">Systems &amp; Cloud résumé <span>PDF</span></a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </details>
    <details>
      <summary><span class="faq-number" aria-hidden="true">03</span><span>Are these professional engagements or independent projects?</span><Plus class="faq-icon" aria-hidden="true" size={20} stroke-width={1.5} /></summary>
      <div class="faq-answer"><p>Both. Each <a href="/work">Work record</a> identifies its provenance: contract engagement, independent business, sanitized architecture, or independent project. Public evidence is linked where available; an independent project does not imply a production deployment.</p></div>
    </details>
    <details>
      <summary><span class="faq-number" aria-hidden="true">04</span><span>What is the best way to contact you?</span><Plus class="faq-icon" aria-hidden="true" size={20} stroke-width={1.5} /></summary>
      <div class="faq-answer"><p>Use the <a href="#contact-form">contact form</a> or email <a href="mailto:lorenztazan@gmail.com">lorenztazan@gmail.com</a>. Tell me about the role, your team, and the environment you need help supporting.</p></div>
    </details>
  </div>
</section>
